      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我用手机打中文还是很慢。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你用拼音输入法吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，但是同样的拼音常常有很多字。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "开始的时候都会这样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我常常要一个一个找。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你可以先打整个词，不要只打一个字。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比如“学习”直接打“xuexi”？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，这样一般更容易找到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那句子也可以一起打吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以先打一小段，系统会给你一些选择。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前太注意每一个字了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "打字的时候先想词和句子会更自然。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样也能练拼音。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，不过别为了速度写错字。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我先保证正确，再慢慢变快。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc024_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这个顺序很好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
